peg/pAtLwQ7ffClqltO_s-3Vsu7cv6aM9Vnifyjg_n8o4P4\"/><figcaption>Work Life Balance｜只需4個步驟，即可將周末延長？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Work Life Balance｜只需4個步驟，即可將周末延長？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240408/853989664715968512523704.jpeg/709fTeKRKW9Buk8QiJykJh_SRLN3-afZH6yenx-snp8\"/><figcaption>Work Life Balance｜只需4個步驟，即可將周末延長？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>一年出國4次卻爽12個月！社畜神邏輯網讚翻：每天都活在期待</p><p>求職問午休遭酸「沒教養」 公司怒嗆：喜歡休息為什麼要工作？</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T08:18:52.906932+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1835,"images":30,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}